test(sync): a credential containing HTML-special characters reaches the request unescaped

Regression test for 62cb4551. Mutation-checked directly: reverting the
Environment construction to `new Environment($loader)` (no autoescape option)
turns the assertion's expected `AB&CD"EF<GH>IJ` into the actual
`AB&amp;CD&quot;EF&lt;GH&gt;IJ` — the exact corruption shape that sent a real
xxllnc API key out wrong on every call for a full session before being found.
